    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Hi everyone,\r\nI was able to disable `indentscope` for some filetypes with:\r\n```lua\r\n    local disabled_filetypes = { 'NvimTree', 'alpha', 'help' }\r\n    vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('FileType', {\r\n      group = vim.api.nvim_create_augroup('MiniIndentScopeDisable', { clear = true }),\r\n      callback = function(opts)\r\n        local ftype = vim.bo[opts.buf].filetype\r\n        if vim.tbl_contains(disabled_filetypes, ftype) then\r\n          vim.b[opts.buf].miniindentscope_disable = true\r\n        end\r\n      end,\r\n    })\r\n```\r\n\r\nHow would you go disabling `indentscope` inside the floating window opened by `vim.lsp.buf.hover`?\r\nI've tried attaching an autocmd to `WinNew` (following this [comment](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/26548#issuecomment-1852958452)) I just can't figure it out 😅\r\n\r\nThanks!",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi everyone,<br>\nI was able to disable <code class=\"notranslate\">indentscope</code> for some filetypes with:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"    local disabled_filetypes = { 'NvimTree', 'alpha', 'help' }\n    vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('FileType', {\n      group = vim.api.nvim_create_augroup('MiniIndentScopeDisable', { clear = true }),\n      callback = function(opts)\n        local ftype = vim.bo[opts.buf].filetype\n        if vim.tbl_contains(disabled_filetypes, ftype) then\n          vim.b[opts.buf].miniindentscope_disable = true\n        end\n      end,\n    })\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">    <span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">disabled_filetypes</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>NvimTree<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>alpha<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>help<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>}\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_create_autocmd</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>FileType<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, {\n      <span class=\"pl-smi\">group</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_create_augroup</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>MiniIndentScopeDisable<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">clear</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span> }),\n      <span class=\"pl-en\">callback</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">opts</span>)\n        <span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">ftype</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">bo</span>[<span class=\"pl-smi\">opts</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">buf</span>].<span class=\"pl-e\">filetype</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">tbl_contains</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">disabled_filetypes</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">ftype</span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">then</span>\n          <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">b</span>[<span class=\"pl-smi\">opts</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">buf</span>].<span class=\"pl-e\">miniindentscope_disable</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>,\n    })</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">How would you go disabling <code class=\"notranslate\">indentscope</code> inside the floating window opened by <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.lsp.buf.hover</code>?<br>\nI've tried attaching an autocmd to <code class=\"notranslate\">WinNew</code> (following this <a href=\"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/26548#issuecomment-1852958452\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/neovim/neovim/issues/26548/hovercard\">comment</a>) I just can't figure it out 😅</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks!</p>",
    "bodyText": "Hi everyone,\nI was able to disable indentscope for some filetypes with:\n    local disabled_filetypes = { 'NvimTree', 'alpha', 'help' }\n    vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('FileType', {\n      group = vim.api.nvim_create_augroup('MiniIndentScopeDisable', { clear = true }),\n      callback = function(opts)\n        local ftype = vim.bo[opts.buf].filetype\n        if vim.tbl_contains(disabled_filetypes, ftype) then\n          vim.b[opts.buf].miniindentscope_disable = true\n        end\n      end,\n    })\nHow would you go disabling indentscope inside the floating window opened by vim.lsp.buf.hover?\nI've tried attaching an autocmd to WinNew (following this comment) I just can't figure it out 😅\nThanks!",
